            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when games were tough? Return to the Golden Age of arcades with an all-NEW hardcore action experience that pulls no punches! Volgarr the Viking possesses all the hallmarks of the true classics - simple controls, high challenge, and meticulous design - combined with hand-made pixel animation, an epic soundtrack, and buckets of blood. Flex your gaming muscles and step into the arena with Volgarr the Viking. We dare you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tClassic hardcore arcade action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSeven worlds to explore across 30+ maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t40+ unique traps and enemies, including screen-filling bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThousands of frames of handcrafted pixel animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOrchestrated soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMeticulous control design with full customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFull controller support (including legacy DirectInput devices!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSteam achievements and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMultiple paths through the game and multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAwesome retro-style game manual!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Temporary text for UNRIP connection: UNRIP-VERIFY-AA0BB3E0320F0D31F9F77F55</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember when games were tough? Return to the Golden Age of arcades with an all-NEW hardcore action experience that pulls no punches! Volgarr the Viking possesses all the hallmarks of the true classics - simple controls, high challenge, and meticulous design - combined with hand-made pixel animation, an epic soundtrack, and buckets of blood. Flex your gaming muscles and step into the arena with Volgarr the Viking. We dare you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tClassic hardcore arcade action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSeven worlds to explore across 30+ maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t40+ unique traps and enemies, including screen-filling bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThousands of frames of handcrafted pixel animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOrchestrated soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMeticulous control design with full customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tFull controller support (including legacy DirectInput devices!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tSteam achievements and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMultiple paths through the game and multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAwesome retro-style game manual!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Temporary text for UNRIP connection: UNRIP-VERIFY-AA0BB3E0320F0D31F9F77F55</p>",
